 (Stiven R)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-28T04:03:05Z","email":"stiven.ruiz.991031@gmail.com","name":"Parabellam (Stiven R)"},"message":"[SR] Add: Organization management and improve shark attack import\n\nIntroduces GraphQL schema and resolvers for organization management. Refactors shark attack import to accept organizationId, updates backend logic for import, and improves event publishing. Changes ''age'' field from Int to String in GraphQL schema and validation. Updates frontend to support new import flow, adds modal for related cases by country, and improves i18n and UI consistency. Also updates repository URLs and dependencies.","tree":{"sha":"2862d52f920320ad759e665a3d41ef898ec7bf36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stiven-NebulaE/ms-facts-mng-week-3/git/trees/2862d52f920320ad759e665a3d41ef898ec7bf36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stiven-NebulaE/ms-facts-mng-week-3/git/commits/8b40c120a5634155609c233c31eaadb42450d60c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51241969?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parabellam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parabellam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parabellam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parabellam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Parabellam","id":51241969,"login":"Parabellam","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjQxOTY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parabellam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parabellam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parabellam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parabellam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parabellam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/