ese files provide guidelines for AI coding assistants using OpenSpec for spec-driven development, including a three-stage workflow, CLI commands, directory structure, and best practices.\n`project.md` defines the overall project context, purpose, tech stack, and conventions.","tree":{"sha":"a29e5f31e5bd293046b8f427b371f215fc54449c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/trees/a29e5f31e5bd293046b8f427b371f215fc54449c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/commits/63b44f913666a9a480dc07315395bcccd2ce0169","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commit/63b44f913666a9a480dc07315395bcccd2ce0169","node_id":"C_kwDOPnGvptoAKDYzYjQ0ZjkxMzY2NmE5YTQ4MGRjMDczMTUzOTViY2NjZDJjZTAxNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commit/bc75a6579df2f338bbd5ea800c96d41abc1e2647","sha":"bc75a6579df2f338bbd5ea800c96d41abc1e2647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/bc75a6579df2f338bbd5ea800c96d41abc1e2647"}],"sha":"63b44f913666a9a480dc07315395bcccd2ce0169","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/63b44f913666a9a480dc07315395bcccd2ce0169"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/bc75a6579df2f338bbd5ea800c96d41abc1e2647/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T14:05:48Z","email":"gmpho@example.com","name":"Gmpho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T14:05:48Z","email":"gmpho@example.com","name":"Gmpho"},"message":"feat(runtime-types): Elevate Worker API definitions and introduce rich media processing\n\nThis update significantly refines the Cloudflare Workers runtime type declarations, enhancing developer experience and unlocking a new suite of functionalities.\n\nKey improvements include:\n- Comprehensive Web API documentation: Extensive JSDoc comments now provide detailed MDN references for core Web APIs, improving clarity and usability.\n- Advanced media manipulation: Introduce a dedicated MediaBinding interface with capabilities for transforming media streams, including video, audio, and spritesheet generation.\n- Expanded AI inference options: Integrate additional AI models and refine tool-calling mechanisms within text generation outputs.\n- Enhanced data persistence: Upgrade D1 bindings with detailed metadata and Durable Objects with direct KV access and improved type safety via generic properties.\n- CORS flexibility: Add ''ALLOWED_ORIGINS'' environment variable for explicit control over cross-origin resource sharing.👍","tree":{"sha":"078919d6a3a21565b74513b4019710493280fdf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/trees/078919d6a3a21565b74513b4019710493280fdf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/commits/bc75a6579df2f338bbd5ea800c96d41abc1e2647","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commit/bc75a6579df2f338bbd5ea800c96d41abc1e2647","node_id":"C_kwDOPnGvptoAKGJjNzVhNjU3OWRmMmYzMzhiYmQ1ZWE4MDBjOTZkNDFhYmMxZTI2NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commit/e1fdcec189415da73ecef1c10b71ff5fc72116f6","sha":"e1fdcec189415da73ecef1c10b71ff5fc72116f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/e1fdcec189415da73ecef1c10b71ff5fc72116f6"}],"sha":"bc75a6579df2f338bbd5ea800c96d41abc1e2647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/bc75a6579df2f338bbd5ea800c96d41abc1e2647"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/e1fdcec189415da73ecef1c10b71ff5fc72116f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T13:05:45Z","email":"gmpho@example.com","name":"Gmpho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T13:05:45Z","email":"gmpho@example.com","name":"Gmpho"},"message":"feat(env): handle worker URL resolution based on deployment origin\n\nThis update modifies the ''getWorkerUrl'' function to dynamically determine\nthe correct worker URL based on the deployment environment.\nIt ensures a fixed localhost URL for local development.\nFor deployed environments, it checks if the frontend''s origin matches the\nbuild-time worker URL. This allows for relative paths when the worker\nself-hosts the frontend and absolute paths otherwise.","tree":{"sha":"a996dad85683637154c3b10a019beb9ac8a90346","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/trees/a996dad85683637154c3b10a019beb9ac8a90346"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/commits/e1fdcec189415da73ecef1c10b71ff5fc72116f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commit/e1fdcec189415da73ecef1c10b71ff5fc72116f6","node_id":"C_kwDOPnGvptoAKGUxZmRjZWMxODk0MTVkYTczZWNlZjFjMTBiNzFmZjVmYzcyMTE2ZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commit/4ae8292f2d0328dff56e7fc8794eac220c5703e2","sha":"4ae8292f2d0328dff56e7fc8794eac220c5703e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/4ae8292f2d0328dff56e7fc8794eac220c5703e2"}],"sha":"e1fdcec189415da73ecef1c10b71ff5fc72116f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/e1fdcec189415da73ecef1c10b71ff5fc72116f6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/4ae8292f2d0328dff56e7fc8794eac220c5703e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T10:21:18Z","email":"gmpho@example.com","name":"Gmpho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T10:21:18Z","email":"gmpho@example.com","name":"Gmpho"},"message":"chore(worker): improve code style and config organization\n\nReorder assets binding in wrangler.toml for better structure.\nAdd blank lines for readability in index.ts and format Project interface.\nExplicitly return 404 for unused service worker route.","tree":{"sha":"a87e2493ee4c597ade0675280247ce74b6f141f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/trees/a87e2493ee4c597ade0675280247ce74b6f141f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/commits/4ae8292f2d0328dff56e7fc8794eac220c5703e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commit/4ae8292f2d0328dff56e7fc8794eac220c5703e2","node_id":"C_kwDOPnGvptoAKDRhZTgyOTJmMmQwMzI4ZGZmNTZlN2ZjODc5NGVhYzIyMGM1NzAzZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commit/e39c1a841f1451c15fe00cbf31a605d6410a071f","sha":"e39c1a841f1451c15fe00cbf31a605d6410a071f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/e39c1a841f1451c15fe00cbf31a605d6410a071f"}],"sha":"4ae8292f2d0328dff56e7fc8794eac220c5703e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/4ae8292f2d0328dff56e7fc8794eac220c5703e2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/e39c1a841f1451c15fe00cbf31a605d6410a071f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-19T18:49:17Z","email":"gmpho@example.com","name":"Gmpho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-19T18:49:17Z","email":"gmpho@example.com","name":"Gmpho"},"message":"feat(env): centralize worker URL and improve worker API status\n\nFrontend now uses a centralized `env.ts` for `VITE_WORKER_URL` configuration, enabling dynamic resolution for local development.\nThe worker''s root endpoint (`/`) now serves a dedicated, styled API status page for better information.\nEnhanced CORS middleware in the worker provides more robust origin handling across different environments.\nUpgraded the Gemini model version used by the worker for chat functionality to `gemini-2.5-flash`.","tree":{"sha":"251b442d93a49a8e80ea1c074310acfe46115544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/trees/251b442d93a49a8e80ea1c074310acfe46115544"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/commits/e39c1a841f1451c15fe00cbf31a605d6410a071f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commit/e39c1a841f1451c15fe00cbf31a605d6410a071f","node_id":"C_kwDOPnGvptoAKGUzOWMxYTg0MWYxNDUxYzE1ZmUwMGNiZjMxYTYwNWQ2NDEwYTA3MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commit/8f889b93955ab57e0b3c2d3711c494eb7534e2dc","sha":"8f889b93955ab57e0b3c2d3711c494eb7534e2dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/8f889b93955ab57e0b3c2d3711c494eb7534e2dc"}],"sha":"e39c1a841f1451c15fe00cbf31a605d6410a071f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/e39c1a841f1451c15fe00cbf31a605d6410a071f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commits/8f889b93955ab57e0b3c2d3711c494eb7534e2dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-19T09:25:41Z","email":"gmpho@example.com","name":"Gmpho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-19T09:25:41Z","email":"gmpho@example.com","name":"Gmpho"},"message":"updated routes vite worker👍","tree":{"sha":"3583b00ab1da62aa76aaa6916bf30e1d47b3b6be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/trees/3583b00ab1da62aa76aaa6916b