"name":"User Name"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-25T15:28:08Z","email":"user@example.com","name":"User Name"},"message":"docs: Update documentation to reflect recent enhancements and cleanup ✨📚\n\nThis commit updates various documentation files to synchronize them with the latest\nfeatures, security enhancements, and architectural changes implemented in the project.\n\nKey updates include:\n- README.md: Updated features, technology stack, security, and quick start. 🚀\n- GEMINI.md: Updated key features, API access model, guardrails, tool orchestration, and quick start. 🔒\n- docs/AGENTS.md: Updated contact form to include feedback. 💬\n- docs/API.md: Updated contact form tool to include feedback. 🛠️\n- docs/ARCHITECTURE.md: Updated to reflect client-side rate limiting, accessibility, i18n, user feedback, offline support, and distributed KV-backed worker rate limiting. Also updated the Mermaid diagram. 🏗️\n- docs/CI_CD.md: Updated recommended secrets, deploy-worker job, and GitHub Actions snippet. ⚙️\n- docs/CODE_REVIEW.md: Updated to reflect completed testing suite, backend input validation, and hardened CSP. ✅\n- docs/Code_Review_Report.md: Updated descriptions for frontend/index.ts, frontend/chatbot.ts, worker/src/index.ts, worker/src/rateLimiter.ts, worker/src/guardrails.ts, worker/src/tools/displayContactForm.ts, vite.config.ts, playwright.config.ts, .github/workflows/static.yml, and GEMINI.md. 📝\n- docs/DEPLOY.md: Updated secrets, KV namespace creation, CI/CD overview, wrangler.toml template, managing worker secrets, and quick reference commands. 🚀\n- docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md: Updated rate limiting and guardrail descriptions. ⚠️\n- docs/LANGCHAIN_AGENTS.md: Updated to reflect LLM-driven tool orchestration and removed duplicated sections. 🧠\n- docs/MCP.md: Updated to reflect worker-side tool orchestration. ☁️\n- docs/REFERENCES.md: Updated Cloudflare Workers testing links and added new references. 🔗\n- docs/SECURITY_AUDIT_REPORT.md: Added a detailed security audit report. 🛡️\n- docs/TESTING.md: Updated to reflect comprehensive test suite with Playwright E2E and Vitest unit testing. 🧪\n- docs/architecture.mmd: Updated to combine KV stores. 📊\n\nAlso includes cleanup of old documentation files and removal of worker/wrangler.prod.toml. 🧹","tree":{"sha":"b22e3d61b3e838e50a9f0cecb28068b110193e69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/trees/b22e3d61b3e838e50a9f0cecb28068b110193e69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/git/commits/43a5e7883ff41fdda66b6efbd4f35fd1513261b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7228420?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/superman32432432","id":7228420,"login":"superman32432432","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjg0MjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Gmpho/AI-powered-Static-portfolio/commit/43a5e7883ff41fdda66b6efbd4f35fd1513261b3","node_id":"C_kwDOPnGvptoAKDQzYTVlNzg4M2ZmNDFmZGRhNjZiNmVmYmQ0ZjM1ZmQxNTEzMjYxYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Gmpho/AI-powered-Sta