ithub.com/users/gamingopgamingop","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge/commits/6db4ca4f66c0d8d6b1715faf1f285c1eb6230415/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-27T05:29:03Z","email":"gamingopgamingop67@gmail.com","name":"gamingopgamingop"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T05:29:03Z","email":"gamingopgamingop67@gmail.com","name":"gamingopgamingop"},"message":"feat: add initial project structure with authentication and user management\n\nThis commit introduces the foundational codebase for the application, built with the IntentJS framework. The structure includes:\n\n- Core application setup with configuration files for app, auth, database, cache, queue, mailer, logger, storage, HTTP, and localization.\n- User domain implementation with model, repository, service, transformer, and validators.\n- Authentication system featuring registration, login, email verification, and password reset (OTP-based) flows.\n- HTTP layer with controllers and kernel setup.\n- Console commands and service providers for application bootstrapping.\n- Database migrations for users and jobs tables.\n- Utility functions and error handling.\n- Development tooling (ESLint, TypeScript config, environment example).","tree":{"sha":"df9015b66142a4184aef27d6cf7047859682e1de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge/git/trees/df9015b66142a4184aef27d6cf7047859682e1de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge/git/commits/6db4ca4f66c0d8d6b1715faf1f285c1eb6230415","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154999417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gaming