cb243cca5ea13682c8386326f6089b442a91"}],"sha":"6e7d2bcb4136b77d7cd05390c561c02bf6f5fbf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge/commits/6e7d2bcb4136b77d7cd05390c561c02bf6f5fbf6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154999417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gamingopgamingop","id":154999417,"login":"gamingopgamingop","node_id":"U_kgDOCT0aeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge/commits/fa47cb243cca5ea13682c8386326f6089b442a91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T18:20:30Z","email":"gamingopgamingop67@gmail.com","name":"gamingopgamingop"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T18:20:30Z","email":"gamingopgamingop67@gmail.com","name":"gamingopgamingop"},"message":"feat: add new project with authentication and user management\n\nThis commit introduces a new backend project built with the IntentJS framework. The project includes:\n\n- Full authentication system with registration, login, email verification, and password reset functionality\n- User model, repository, service, and transformer layers\n- RESTful API controllers for user and auth endpoints\n- Database migrations for users and job queues\n- Comprehensive configuration for database (PostgreSQL), caching (in-memory), storage (local), mailer (Mailgun), and queue (Redis)\n- Development tooling including TypeScript, ESLint, Prettier, and Jest testing setup\n- Console commands and scheduled tasks infrastructure\n- Internationalization support with English language files\n- Environment configuration with example files\n\nThe project is configured with PostgreSQL as the default database, in-memory caching, local storage, Mailgun for email, and Redis for job queues.","tree":{"sha":"be696268b1384383e8ee970f954d936c88b2c63a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge/git/trees/be696268b1384383e8ee970f954d936c88b2c63a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge/git/commits/fa47cb243cca5ea13682c8386326f6089b442a91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154999417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gamingopgamingop","id":154999417,"login":"gamingopgamingop","node_id":"U_kgDOCT0aeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://a