mingopgamingop","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge/commits/fe1dbb11b5c0cb476367102fe07b61da1b333a22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-24T18:21:32Z","email":"gamingopgamingop67@gmail.com","name":"gamingopgamingop"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-24T18:21:32Z","email":"gamingopgamingop67@gmail.com","name":"gamingopgamingop"},"message":"feat: initialize new Intent.js backend project with authentication\n\nThis commit adds a new backend project built with the Intent.js framework. The project includes a complete authentication system with user registration, login, email verification, and password reset functionality using OTP.\n\nKey components added:\n- User model with database migration\n- Authentication controller with validation\n- JWT-based token generation and verification\n- OTP generation for password reset\n- Email service integration\n- Database repository pattern implementation\n- Configuration files for app, auth, database, cache, queue, mailer, and storage\n- Console commands and service providers\n- Error handling and exception filters\n- Test setup with Jest configuration\n- Localization support with English language file\n- File upload system with local storage\n- Complete project structure following Intent.js conventions","tree":{"sha":"ac65e34939ec71ea56fb7a7e5f1cd41fa42e0671","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge/git/trees/ac65e34939ec71ea56fb7a7e5f1cd41fa42e0671"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge/git/commits/fe1dbb11b5c0cb476367102fe07b61da1b333a22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154999417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/follo