gDOCT0aeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gamingopgamingop","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge/commits/7963ea018d1222ac9a8dded9bff543bebdad59a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-24T18:03:28Z","email":"gamingopgamingop67@gmail.com","name":"gamingopgamingop"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-24T18:03:28Z","email":"gamingopgamingop67@gmail.com","name":"gamingopgamingop"},"message":"feat: initialize backend project with authentication and user management\n\nThis commit introduces a new backend project built with the Intent.js framework. The project includes a complete authentication system with user registration, login, email verification, and password reset functionality via OTP. The architecture follows a modular structure with controllers, services, repositories, models, and transformers.\n\nKey additions:\n- User authentication endpoints (register, login, verify email, forgot password)\n- PostgreSQL database integration with migrations for users and jobs tables\n- JWT-based authentication with configurable secrets and TTL\n- Email service integration for OTP delivery\n- File storage configuration with local disk support\n- Comprehensive configuration files for app, database, cache, queue, mailer, and logging\n- Console commands and scheduled tasks infrastructure\n- E2E testing setup with Jest\n- Environment configuration and project tooling (ESLint, TypeScript, etc.)","tree":{"sha":"25cda170757f4f4bf5af23e3f2133e13f5a0b071","url":"https://api.git