s\n Copies data/ and images/ directories\n Includes all configuration files (_headers, _redirects, etc.)\n Ready for deployment on any static hosting platform\n\n Deployment commands updated:\n npm run build - Creates dist directory\n npm run deploy:netlify - Prepares for Netlify deployment\n Build command: ''npm run build''\n Publish directory: ''dist/''\n\n Build output includes:\n All JavaScript modules (auth, payment, reviews, etc.)\n CSS and HTML files\n Product images and data (162 images, 4 JSON files)\n Service worker and manifest for PWA\n Configuration files for proper MIME types\n\n This resolves the Netlify build failure:\n ''dist'' directory is now generated during build\n All static files are properly copied\n MIME types configured for JS/CSS files\n Ready for continuous deployment","tree":{"sha":"8672e75a1881e12d6eda19a0bc3bab6cfc719e38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michaelgermini/ModernShop/git/trees/8672e75a1881e12d6eda19a0bc3bab6cfc719e38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/michaelgermini/ModernShop/git/commits/b6611519f4fab623e77cf44bf42c78c6dacc2830","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15704248?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgermini/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgermini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgermini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgermini/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelgermini","id":15704248,"login":"michaelgermini","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzA0MjQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgermini/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgermini/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgermini/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.co