pos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/9ec626df3e0572843153fbe2367b047a0f4e3eab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:26:55Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:26:55Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(memory-curator): harden boot-scan recovery and session-end retry state\n\nReview of the PR #666 fixes found that the terminal-ledger query took 20\nrows before comparing mtimes, so 20 permanent given-up rows could hide a\nchanged session; it now pages through given-up rows and deleted files do\nnot use the budget. Session-end clears failedPasses only when its pass\nreally ran, the end pass no longer leaks its episode buffer, and a\ngiven-up session whose run throws counts as a failure so the attempt cap\napplies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81532f7761a3dde87e96fc520a857f41d48cc528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/81532f7761a3dde87e96fc520a857f41d48cc528"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/9ec626df3e0572843153fbe2367b047a0f4e3eab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/9ec626df3e0572843153fbe2367b047a0f4e3eab","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKDllYzYyNmRmM2UwNTcyODQzMTUzZmJlMjM2N2IwNDdhMGY0ZTNlYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/9724c25253eeaf103f4c47a96b7c8b21882327a6","sha":"9724c25253eeaf103f4c47a96b7c8b21882327a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/9724c25253eeaf103f4c47a96b7c8b21882327a6"}],"sha":"9ec626df3e0572843153fbe2367b047a0f4e3eab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/9ec626df3e0572843153fbe2367b047a0f4e3eab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/9724c25253eeaf103f4c47a96b7c8b21882327a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:11:44Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:11:44Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(memory-curator): address PR #666 review and degradation-audit failure\n\n- Annotate the boot-scan failure ledger''s fail-soft catch blocks with the\n  degradation-audit `reported` marker; each logs and degrades by design,\n  and the memory-curator count was 24 against a baseline of 20.\n- Count stuck observation rows when the processed purge stops on its row\n  budget; only hard stops skip the count.\n- Re-admit a given-up session whose generation changed even when its\n  mtime is at or below the boot-scan watermark.\n- Clear a session''s failedPasses after the session-end curate settles,\n  including under a rekeyed id, so a later pass does not inherit it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1161a0fe99af61b0650e32e42546e160f4912d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/f1161a0fe99af61b0650e32e42546e160f4912d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/9724c25253eeaf103f4c47a96b7c8b21882327a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/rec