rl":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/4535e0b7493a6cba4b9ad79b32ef58188d9f4e18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:50:03Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:57:48Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(memory-curator): reopen changed given-up sessions and reserve a scan slot\n\nBounded correction for the TASK_2026_621 round-3 review.\n\n- Migration 0053 adds memory_boot_scan_failures.session_mtime_ms (the\n  session file''s generation) and a composite retry index on\n  (workspace_fingerprint, status, last_failed_at, session_id), dropping\n  0052''s now-redundant status index. 0052 is unchanged.\n- recordFailure stores the generation: a given_up row whose file changed\n  reopens as pending with attempt_count 1; an unchanged file stays\n  given_up. A normal-scan success removes the session''s ledger row in any\n  status, so the given-up count drops.\n- Ledger retries no longer starve the normal scan: while the scan has\n  eligible sessions, a retry runs only if a curate slot is left for the scan\n  afterwards (retryAllowed). Deferred retries spend no attempt and are\n  reported as retriesDeferred in the boot-scan event and activity feed.\n- Specs: changed and unchanged given-up sessions, success removing a\n  given_up row with the diagnostics count, maxCuratesPerHour = 1 still\n  curating a new healthy session, 0053 applying on an existing ledger, and\n  the retry query planned on the composite index. Max-version checks are 53.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e236cd11df673e8ae48b63391e803a6b658834f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/8e236cd11df673e8ae48b63391e803a6b658834f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/4535e0b7493a6cba4b9ad79b32ef58188d9f4e18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/4535e0b7493a6cba4b9ad79b32ef58188d9f4e18","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKDQ1MzVlMGI3NDkzYTZjYmE0YjlhZDc5YjMyZWY1ODE4OGQ5ZjRlMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/a181ab1b28a67aaf52ef9745d58b39b6ac507dab","sha":"a181ab1b28a67aaf52ef9745d58b39b6ac507dab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/a181ab1b28a67aaf52ef9745d58b39b6ac507dab"}],"sha":"4535e0b7493a6cba4b9ad79b32ef58188d9f4e18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/4535e0b7493a6cba4b9ad79b32ef58188d9f4e18"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/a181ab1b28a67aaf52ef9745d58b39b6ac507dab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:25:34Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:57:48Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(memory-curator): retry failed boot-scan sessions through a failure ledger\n\nReview round 2 for TASK_2026_621: the 7-day hold dropped a failed session\nolder than the cold-start window after one attempt and blocked every later\nhealthy session behind a younger one; the activity feed also cut boot-scan\nstats to the first three, hiding stalled and failed counts.\n\n- Migration 0052 adds memory_boot_scan_failures (keyed like boot_scan_state\n  by workspace fingerprint plus session id; attempt_count, first/last failure\n  time, status pending|given_up, give_up_reason).\n- BootScanRunner records a failed session in the ledger and advances the\n  watermark normally, so later sessions are never blocked. Pending ledger\n  sessions are retried before the scan on each boot (at most 20 per boot,\n  within the existing hourly budget); success removes the row, the third\n  failed attempt sets given_up with a warning, a missing session file is\n  given_up as session-file-missing, and a gate stop ends the retries without\n  starting the scan or spending an attempt. Without a ledger, or when the\n  write fails, a failed pass still stops the scan below it. Timestamps use\n  the runner''s injected clock.\n- Diagnostics: storage health reports bootScanFailuresPending and\n  bootScanFailuresGivenUp; the storage panel shows them; the activity feed\n  shows every boot-scan count and uses the warning tone when a scan stalled,\n  failed or gave up.\n- Migration 0039 is unchanged from the previous round.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c50ec7199e60227ec49d4b40a7a4b1f94c1bff3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/c50ec7199e60227ec49d4b40a7a4b1f94c1bff3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/a181ab1b28a67aaf52ef9745d58b39b6ac507dab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/a181ab1b28a67aaf52ef9745d58b39b6ac507dab","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKGExODFhYjFiMjhhNjdhYWY1MmVmOTc0NWQ1OGIzOWI2YWM1MDdkYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/aae3e441aee2c3da3de5e9c6991d63a75ca2dd58","sha":"aae3e441aee2c3da3de5e9c6991d63a75ca2dd58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/aae3e441aee2c3da3de5e9c6991d63a75ca2dd58"}],"sha":"a181ab1b28a67aaf52ef9745d58b39b6ac507dab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/a181ab1b28a67aaf52ef9745d58b39b6ac507dab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/aae3e441aee2c3da3de5e9c6991d63a75ca2dd58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:36:47Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:57:47Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(memory-curator): stop boot scan and migration 0039 dropping unprocessed observations\n\nReview round 1 for TASK_2026_621 found two remaining loss paths.\n\n- Boot scan: the runBootScan callback mapped the new ''failed'' outcome to\n  ''ran'', so BootScanRunner advanced the watermark past a session that\n  curated nothing. BootScanItemOutcome gains ''failed'': the runner stops and\n  keeps the watermark below the item while the session is younger than the\n  7-day cold-start lookback, and lets an older one past with a warning so\n  one always-failing session cannot block the scan forever. The boot-scan\n  event reports a failed count.\n- Migration 0039 no longer deletes unprocessed observation_queue rows. The\n  runner records applied migrations by version only (no checksum), so\n  installs already past 0039 are unaffected; the skill_synthesis_queue reap\n  is unchanged.\n- Specs: a failed boot-scan pass writes no watermark and holds a persisted\n  one so the next boot retries it; the 7-day bound lets a stale failure\n  past; an old unprocessed row survives 0039 applied through the runner.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65c5a8e12499b990fdebe4ebcba325200b9437cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/65c5a8e12499b990fdebe4ebcba325200b9437cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/aae3e441aee2c3da3de5e9c6991d63a75ca2dd58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/aae3e441aee2c3da3de5e9c6991d63a75ca2dd58","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKGFhZTNlNDQxYWVlMmMzZGEzZGU1ZTljNjk5MWQ2M2E3NWNhMmRkNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/2521773adf3a811069795d8395bab87fa9948ac0","sha":"2521773adf3a811069795d8395bab87fa9948ac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/2521773adf3a811069795d8395bab87fa9948ac0"}],"sha":"aae3e441aee2c3da3de5e9c6991d63a75ca2dd58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/aae3e441aee2c3da3de5e9c6991d63a75ca2dd58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/2521773adf3a811069795d8395bab87fa9948ac0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:20:29Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:57:47Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(memory-curator): keep observations of a failed curation pass\n\nA non-network extract or resolve failure was recorded with outcome ''ran'',\nso MemoryTriggerService marked the drained observation_queue rows processed\nand they were lost without a memory being written (TASK_2026_621 silent\ndrop a).\n\n- CuratorRunOutcome gains ''failed''; CuratorActivityLog.recordError reports it.\n- invokeCurate keeps the rows (and reattaches the episode) for up to\n  MAX_FAILED_PASS_RETRIES (3) consecutive failed passes per session; the\n  next failure marks them processed with a warning so a transcript that\n  always fails is not re-fed forever. A pass that ran resets the count; the\n  counter follows rekeySession and is cleared on stop.\n- PreCompact and boot-scan keep their previous handling of a failed pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e374343576c6b53952eb1a22234077ed8fbe2ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/8e374343576c6b53952eb1a22234077ed8fbe2ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/2521773adf3a811069795d8395bab87fa9948ac0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/2521773adf3a811069795d8395bab87fa9948ac0","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKDI1MjE3NzNhZGYzYTgxMTA2OTc5NWQ4Mzk1YmFiODdmYTk5NDhhYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/53a334969bd3176b00518cb7d48dc2ae40f23f30","sha":"53a334969bd3176b00518cb7d48dc2ae40f23f30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/53a334969bd3176b00518cb7d48dc2ae40f23f30"}],"sha":"2521773adf3a811069795d8395bab87fa9948ac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/2521773adf3a811069795d8395bab87fa9948ac0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/53a334969bd3176b00518cb7d48dc2ae40f23f30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:09:16Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:57:47Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(memory-curator): never delete unprocessed observations in retention\n\nRetention deleted observation_queue rows that extraction never processed\nonce they were older than stuckDays (14), summarising them into the\nobservation_quarantine ledger. With ~59k rows left unprocessed by a stalled\ncurator (TASK_2026_621), the oldest were about to be lost.\n\n- Remove the stuck-quarantine step and its SQL; the only queue DELETE now\n  re-checks processed_at IS NOT NULL.\n- Count unprocessed rows older than stuckDays instead (stuckKept on the run\n  report), warn through the injected Logger when any exist, and record\n  stuck_quarantined = 0.\n- Processed rows keep today''s purge behaviour; the legacy ledger is still\n  pruned.\n- Specs: unprocessed rows far older than stuckDays survive every run on real\n  SQLite while processed old rows are purged; every queue DELETE is guarded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed7592ae6d1cb7f2cddbc57ac311604507e65fa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/ed7592ae6d1cb7f2cddbc57ac311604507e65fa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/53a334969bd3176b00518cb7d48dc2ae40f23f30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/53a334969bd3176b00518cb7d48dc2ae40f23f30","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKDUzYTMzNDk2OWJkMzE3NmIwMDUxOGNiN2Q0OGRjMmFlNDBmMjNmMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/7910f34cffa4ce24f944c741ad080aacf513079f","sha":"7910f34cffa4ce24f944c741ad080aacf513079f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/7910f34cffa4ce24f944c741ad080aacf513079f"}],"sha":"53a334969bd3176b00518cb7d48dc2ae40f23f30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/53a334969bd3176b00518cb7d48dc2ae40f23f30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/5a39c41aa07e8694d1fe055114489fa7b5c42f9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:03:42Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:03:42Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"Merge origin/main into feat/task-617-grok-acp\n\nResolves the content-manifest.json conflict by regenerating it\n(manifest:generate; manifest:check and self-test pass).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"900699793ef3ae9e68160ade8f6d57a453d552dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/900699793ef3ae9e68160ade8f6d57a453d552dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy