/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/5a39c41aa07e8694d1fe055114489fa7b5c42f9f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/86f6a37d4be902ca3246235e6bc259d32674a089/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:51:45Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:51:45Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(cli-agent-runtime): address CodeRabbit review on the Grok lane\n\n- probeCliStdout kills the whole process tree on timeout (detached\n  spawn + whenSpawned -> killProcessTree, as probeCliVersion does), so\n  a timed-out `grok models` behind a .cmd shim leaves no orphan.\n- The Grok permission note now matches decideAcpPermission: allow-once\n  when offered, else the only (persistent) allow option with an info;\n  a request with no allow option is declined.\n- ptah-ui grammar: a literal stats value (vcell) is not optional, in\n  both skill copies; content-manifest.json regenerated.\n\nFixes by an opencode lane; reviewed by a code-logic-reviewer sub-agent\n(APPROVED 8/10), with its wording note applied.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb9989acb0baa1c89e0cdf6cf06c6f4daf38f492","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/cb9989acb0baa1c89e0cdf6cf06c6f4daf38f492"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/86f6a37d4be902ca3246235e6bc259d32674a089","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/86f6a37d4be902ca3246235e6bc259d32674a089","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKDg2ZjZhMzdkNGJlOTAyY2EzMjQ2MjM1ZTZiYzI1OWQzMjY3NGEwODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/922c1e7c527848b9924a4f32d400fb7366d7afd2","sha":"922c1e7c527848b9924a4f32d400fb7366d7afd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/922c1e7c527848b9924a4f32d400fb7366d7afd2"}],"sha":"86f6a37d4be902ca3246235e6bc259d32674a089","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/86f6a37d4be902ca3246235e6bc259d32674a089"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/922c1e7c527848b9924a4f32d400fb7366d7afd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T19:58:37Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T19:58:37Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(chat): fit six installed CLI rows above the Electron settings fold\n\nGrok made a sixth installed row in the Orchestration matrix. The webview\ne2e specs still expected five agents, so the order popover and the\nreachability walk failed and the reachability spec ran the job into its\n20-minute timeout. On Electron the roles summary also fell to 689 px,\nbelow the enforced 660 px fold.\n\n- Expect ''grok'' at the end of the written preferredAgentOrder and the\n  6+2 reference set in the orchestration, reachability and visual specs.\n- Narrow layout: 2 px block padding on matrix header and row cells, and\n  the instance key/tier badges on one line only from 36rem up, so a\n  400 px webview still wraps them. Roles summary: 689 -> 643 px on\n  Electron; VS Code unchanged at 627 px. The fold budget is unchanged.\n\nIndependent review: codex (effort high) REVISE -> APPROVED 8/10.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4224e252ea0fda124529adc238b44b0f4d25d156","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/4224e252ea0fda124529adc238b44b0f4d25d156"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/922c1e7c527848b9924a4f32d400fb7366d7afd2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/922c1e7c527848b9924a4f32d400fb7366d7afd2","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdt