te, queued mid-turn message, stop, resume and\nmodel accept/reject pass against grok 1.0.46. Visual review of the\nOrchestration CLI matrix (dark/light, wide/narrow): APPROVED.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f47ff2e48722466b8d7e2660545b27cf3c2fe7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/2f47ff2e48722466b8d7e2660545b27cf3c2fe7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/04a75511c9738eed0b2f966aa37dc8e2e61671a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/04a75511c9738eed0b2f966aa37dc8e2e61671a0","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKDA0YTc1NTExYzk3MzhlZWQwYjJmOTY2YWEzN2RjOGUyZTYxNjcxYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/2081957809b8cd4c5789a7c9cdebe6d44d946736","sha":"2081957809b8cd4c5789a7c9cdebe6d44d946736","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/2081957809b8cd4c5789a7c9cdebe6d44d946736"}],"sha":"04a75511c9738eed0b2f966aa37dc8e2e61671a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/04a75511c9738eed0b2f966aa37dc8e2e61671a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/2081957809b8cd4c5789a7c9cdebe6d44d946736/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:01:21Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:01:21Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(cli-agent-runtime): always send binding ACP config entries\n\nA binding entry (the Grok model) was skipped with an info when the\nsession did not advertise its option, so a lane could succeed on the\nagent''s default model. The runner now sends a binding entry whether or\nnot it is advertised, and a rejection fails the turn before any prompt.\nNon-binding hints keep the skip-with-info behaviour.\n\nIndepe