ESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/5742aa471302dc4adfe6f390243af043e2e2471c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T16:40:59Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T16:40:59Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"feat(orchestration): decide from evidence and peers before asking the user\n\nAgents now settle open decisions through a decision ladder: evidence\nfirst (code, task folder, docs, memory, web search), then a cross-side\npeer, and the user only for user-reserved decisions (scope intent,\nremovals, irreversible or outward actions, security/privacy/licensing,\nmoney, breaking public changes, hook bypass) or splits the peer cannot\nsettle. Every agent decision is recorded in decisions.md so the user can\naudit and overturn it.\n\nGate 0.1 and Gate 3 become notices instead of questions (lanes default\nto auto; QA agents are chosen by rule). Gates 0, 1.5 and SR run the\nladder before AskUserQuestion. Subagents and lanes send open questions\nto their spawner through ptah_agent_report / SendMessage and fall back\nto ## Clarifications Needed only when no channel exists. The shared\nagent-template rule and the Tribunal relay prompt follow the same ladder.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e1615f597c5eb1f5d6c1bf28f8a124b63803d21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension