NAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/6163b042e0988e69af4598f2c091c8cb5e8d3f9a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:59:40Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:59:40Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"refactor(cli-agent-runtime): phase 1 review fixes for the ACP layer\n\n- AcpVendorProfile: buildSpawn returns AcpSpawnSpec { args, env? }; drop the\n  unused alwaysApproveFlag; isExtensionNotification optional; readonly lists.\n- Transport: a live-child error keeps the pid for tree-kill; listeners are\n  split into stream and lifecycle sets; the readable closes after a short\n  drain grace once the child exits.\n- Session handle: optional injected Logger; a bounded cancel grace before\n  the kill; spawn env forwarded to the transport.\n- Exclude __fixtures__ from the library build.\n- Add the Phase 1 code-logic, code-style and style re-review reports.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9ea6afda8a5826443c0fdfbcdecab56eaf7350a","url":"https://api.github.com/r