ession key\n\nAn unresolved parent session id passed to discardHeldUnboundStarts no\nlonger means \"every session\". It is its own exact key, so a stop with\nno resolved session cannot drop a same-agentId held start that belongs\nto another session before its Task result binds it. Hold and discard\nkeep the same payload-first parent-session resolution.\n\nAddresses the CodeRabbit comment on subagent-hook-handler.ts. Written\non an opencode lane and reviewed cross-side (APPROVED); the remaining\nedge case is recorded as H.14 in context.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6dbac9cf4580ffb5c4eb23c6248c80f4c282b04d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/6dbac9cf4580ffb5c4eb23c6248c80f4c282b04d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/f5cfe3b2cef260304bae24b16521dd6228227cd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html