me, reviews and follow-ups\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7de2ccc87b245a6f185afee3006a3bfcc2196a10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/7de2ccc87b245a6f185afee3006a3bfcc2196a10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/7f0916afc5d5e7fcf43e5a4efa1dc5b49c7fe339","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/7f0916afc5d5e7fcf43e5a4efa1dc5b49c7fe339","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKDdmMDkxNmFmYzVkNWU3ZmNmNDNlNWE0ZWZhMWRjNWI0OWM3ZmUzMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/a3450c37292a23dae0d7d6633f7b7e7417d98308","sha":"a3450c37292a23dae0d7d6633f7b7e7417d98308","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/a3450c37292a23dae0d7d6633f7b7e7417d98308"}],"sha":"7f0916afc5d5e7fcf43e5a4efa1dc5b49c7fe339","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/7f0916afc5d5e7fcf43e5a4efa1dc5b49c7fe339"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/a3450c37292a23dae0d7d6633f7b7e7417d98308/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:07:53Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:07:53Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(vscode-core,electron): push the fresh git status once the timeout backoff closes\n\nA watcher refresh that lands inside GitInfoService''s 30 s status-timeout\nbackoff broadcasts \"unavailable (timeout)\", so a change made during a host\nstall never reached the UI until an unrelated filesystem event. The git\nwatcher owns the GIT_STATUS_UPDATE broadcast, so it now schedules exactly\none follow-up push for when the window closes (replaced not stacked,\nunref''d, cleared on stop, inert after a workspace switch) and carries the\nskipped causes into it. GitInfoService exposes the remaining backoff and the\nskip path keeps invalidating the read cache.\n\nThe stress harness now counts a refresh cycle at `git status`: the separate\nrev-parse probe is gone from the status pipeline, so counting the probe\nreported zero cycles.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9eaf6573c46ccf16deb1609134e854bd16cc835","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/c9eaf6573c46ccf16deb1609134e854bd16cc835"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/a3450c37292a23dae0d7d6633f7b7e7417d98308","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/a3450c37292a23dae0d7d6633f7b7e7417d98308","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKGEzNDUwYzM3MjkyYTIzZGFlMGQ3ZDY2MzNmN2I3ZTc0MTdkOTgzMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/b568407fe300a7fae571dfc70986510b9592a069","sha":"b568407fe300a7fae571dfc70986510b9592a069","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/b568407fe300a7fae571dfc70986510b9592a069"}],"sha":"a3450c37292a23dae0d7d6633f7b7e7417d98308","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/a3450c37292a23dae0d7d6633f7b7e7417d98308"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/b568407fe300a7fae571dfc70986510b9592a069/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:43:15Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:43:15Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(chat-ui): keep the stats strip alive on unknown statuses and name the lanes pill\n\nownerStatusNote threw on a usage status this webview build does not know. A\nnewer backend talking to a cached or desynced client (version skew) would fail\nthe whole stats view model and blank the strip; it now keeps the compile-time\nexhaustiveness guard but returns the generic \"Usage unavailable\" note at runtime.\n\nThe LANES pill carried aria-label on a roleless span, which ARIA 1.2 does not\nname, so screen readers never heard the lane count. The pill now takes\nrole=\"img\" so its label becomes the accessible name.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7061507afeca7ece2debd7bf4f6f5de9969d5223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/7061507afeca7ece2debd7bf4f6f5de9969d5223"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/b568407fe300a7fae571dfc70986510b9592a069","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/b568407fe300a7fae571dfc70986510b9592a069","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKGI1Njg0MDdmZTMwMGE3ZmFlNTcxZGZjNzA5ODY1MTBiOTU5MmEwNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/683c1d3a8ad8c6d5549dde3f6cb72afad7fb74bc","sha":"683c1d3a8ad8c6d5549dde3f6cb72afad7fb74bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/683c1d3a8ad8c6d5549dde3f6cb72afad7fb74bc"}],"sha":"b568407fe300a7fae571dfc70986510b9592a069","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/b568407fe300a7fae571dfc70986510b9592a069"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/683c1d3a8ad8c6d5549dde3f6cb72afad7fb74bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:29:09Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:29:09Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(auth-providers): expire the observed Antigravity account and omit fractionless windows\n\nThe language-server account observation never expired, so once the server\nvanished or became ambiguous, lane quota kept being attributed to the last\nobserved account even after the user switched accounts in the CLI. The\nobservation now carries an observedAt, is authoritative only for\nANTIGRAVITY_OBSERVED_ACCOUNT_MAX_AGE_MS (5 min), and the reader clears it\nwhen discovery finds no unique server, when every candidate fails, and on\ndiscovery failure. Resolution then falls back to google_accounts.json and\nthe CLI store. The email is still hashed only in the resolver.\n\nA model config without quotaInfo.remainingFraction was coerced to 0 and\nshown as 100 % used; it is now omitted, and a reply with no reportable\nwindow stays unavailable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f13d557a04d0ed060e6d9f6dcd2cca4799a0f795","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/f13d557a04d0ed060e6d9f6dcd2cca4799a0f795"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/683c1d3a8ad8c6d5549dde3f6cb72afad7fb74bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/683c1d3a8ad8c6d5549dde3f6cb72afad7fb74bc","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKDY4M2MxZDNhOGFkOGM2ZDU1NDlkZGUzZjZjYjcyYWZhZDdmYjc0YmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/ff248a9ff1c8f1ffa3e81ec6c8c535bb6957b206","sha":"ff248a9ff1c8f1ffa3e81ec6c8c535bb6957b206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/ff248a9ff1c8f1ffa3e81ec6c8c535bb6957b206"}],"sha":"683c1d3a8ad8c6d5549dde3f6cb72afad7fb74bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/683c1d3a8ad8c6d5549dde3f6cb72afad7fb74bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/ff248a9ff1c8f1ffa3e81ec6c8c535bb6957b206/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:24:12Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:24:12Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"refactor(chat-ui): move the per-model usage table into its own component\n\nsession-stats-summary had grown to 1097 lines, past the warn-level\nmax-lines limit. The per-model breakdown table now lives in a standalone\nOnPush session-model-breakdown component that takes the snapshot as a\nsignal input. The parent keeps the expand/collapse state and both\nModels toggle buttons, and the table DOM, classes, test ids and\naria-label are unchanged. The parent''s inline styles move to\nsession-stats-summary.component.css; the model-usage-row grid goes with\nthe rows to the child.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bde527b48e6d35f8fdcff33ad31d052384b3cb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/4bde527b48e6d35f8fdcff33ad31d052384b3cb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/ff248a9ff1c8f1ffa3e81ec6c8c535bb6957b206","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/ff248a9ff1c8f1ffa3e81ec6c8c535bb6957b206","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKGZmMjQ4YTlmZjFjOGYxZmZhM2U4MWVjNmM4YzUzNWJiNjk1N2IyMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/81c2e674dbc6c3ea20e34c78b80594421feb5a24","sha":"81c2e674dbc6c3ea20e34c78b80594421feb5a24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/81c2e674dbc6c3ea20e34c78b80594421feb5a24"}],"sha":"ff248a9ff1c8f1ffa3e81ec6c8c535bb6957b206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/ff248a9ff1c8f1ffa3e81ec6c8c535bb6957b206"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/81c2e674dbc6c3ea20e34c78b80594421feb5a24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:22:21Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:22:21Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(vscode-core): ride out host stalls in the git status refresh\n\ngit itself answers status in ~180 ms; the \"unavailable (timeout)\" results\ncame from the host stalling under heavy agent load (process creation and\nevent-loop lag), which pushed even trivial git calls past the 10 s default.\n\n- Give the status read and both diff --numstat reads a 30 s budget\n  (GIT_STATUS_TIMEOUT_MS), still below LONG_GIT_CALL_MS so they keep the\n  interactive lane.\n- Drop the separate repository probe spawn from computeGitInfo: git\n  status''s own exit-128 \"not a git repository\" refusal now classifies a\n  non-repository, so each refresh spawns one git child fewer.\n- After a timeout, skip watcher-driven refreshes of that root for 30 s\n  instead of queueing more git children behind the same stall; a\n  user-driven getGitInfo always runs and a definitive answer clears the\n  window.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a89c97dd4051f35aa50e6347197c8e91389b6bb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/a89c97dd4051f35aa50e6347197c8e91389b6bb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/81c2e674dbc6c3ea20e34c78b80594421feb5a24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/81c2e674dbc6c3ea20e34c78b80594421feb5a24","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKDgxYzJlNjc0ZGJjNmMzZWEyMGUzNGM3OGI4MDU5NDQyMWZlYjVhMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/daac44d517619ff914a09516e7522227e53180b8","sha":"daac44d517619ff914a09516e7522227e53180b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/daac44d517619ff914a09516e7522227e53180b8"}],"sha":"81c2e674dbc6c3ea20e34c78b80594421feb5a24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/81c2e674dbc6c3ea20e34c78b80594421feb5a24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/daac44d517619ff914a09516e7522227e53180b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:17:13Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:17:13Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"docs(shared): document the cli-store to account quotaOwner upgrade\n\nThe AgentProcessInfo.quotaOwner JSDoc still said the owner could only move\nfrom an unknown identity kind to a known one. Since the lane-owner upgrade\nwork, upgradeQuotaOwner also re-attributes a run from a cli-store owner to\nthe account owner of the same provider, because the account is what the\nprovider bills. Bring the shared contract comment in line so consumers do\nnot assume a known owner is immutable. Doc-only; no type or code change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20d5b4465dc607747fe8fc5f6609e1cfa129c3ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/20d5b4465dc607747fe8fc5f6609e1cfa129c3ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/daac44d517619ff914a09516e7522227e53180b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/daac44d517619ff914a09516e7522227e53180b8","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKGRhYWM0NGQ1MTc2MTlmZjkxNGEwOTUxNmU3NTIyMjI3ZTUzMTgwYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/e56c1583d33c15c61f45c634b4ed70b6ae95b1ad","sha":"e56c1583d33c15c61f45c634b4ed70b6ae95b1ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/e56c1583d33c15c61f45c634b4ed70b6ae95b1ad"}],"sha":"daac44d517619ff914a09516e7522227e53180b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/daac44d517619ff914a09516e7522227e53180b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/e56c1583d33c15c61f45c634b4ed70b6ae95b1ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:09:17Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:09:17Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(auth-providers): drop sourceless proxy observations and bound the plan-usage cache\n\nA proxy observation with no owner key and no source id used to land on one\nshared \"proxy:unidentified\" owner, so a 429 from one unidentified proxy put\nevery other unidentified proxy in cooldown and any 2xx cleared it. Such\nobservations cannot be attributed safely, so they are now logged at debug and\ndropped; observations carrying a source id keep their per-instance owner.\n\nThe plan-usage cache grew by one entry per owner key for the life of the\nprocess. It is now capped at PLAN_USAGE_MAX_OWNERS (64): after each write the\nleast recently read entries beyond the cap are evicted, owners with an\nin-flight read are spared, and an evicted owner''s failure timestamp goes with\nit. Eviction is by count, not age, so the stale rule can still re-serve an old\navailable reading.\n\nThe Ollama reader spec now records that placeholder keys are rejected upstream\nby plan-credential.source.ts, so its fixture is always a usable secret.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"798420bed9aab2bb8d8a074009e692dee26500d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/798420bed9aab2bb8d8a074009e692dee26500d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/e56c1583d33c15c61f45c634b4ed70b6ae95b1ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"h