"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/d1f7c4625b212bce9c6987f05bd874c649f5f4e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:50:46Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:50:46Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(chat-ui): keep stats text readable and the lanes subtotal on one line\n\nThe Model and Context values printed purple-400/cyan-400 ink that measures\n1.4-2.4:1 on the light chips, and the cost badge''s stock success-content ink\nmeasures 2.64:1 in the dark theme. Values now use base-content ink (the\nstats-grid rule: semantic colour only on tints and borders) and the badge\nuses the measured ok-solid-text ink, reaching 4.5:1 in both themes.\n\nThe LANES subtotal caption truncates with a tooltip instead of wrapping,\nthe LANES pill gets an accessible name since its face is only a count, and\nownerStatusNote lists every usage status with a never check so a new status\nfails the type check instead of falling into a default.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dcdaebf2a934657dda23c27b0457eadc46248020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/dcdaebf2a934657dda23c27b0457eadc46248020"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/d1f7c4625b212bce9c6987f05bd874c649f5f4e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/d1f7c4625b212bce9c6987f05bd874c649f5f4e4","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKGQxZjdjNDYyNWIyMTJiY2U5YzY5ODdmMDViZDg3NGM2NDlmNWY0ZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/002495a1cb7712a9ce2320bc94541543c857205b","sha":"002495a1cb7712a9ce2320bc94541543c857205b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/002495a1cb7712a9ce2320bc94541543c857205b"}],"sha":"d1f7c4625b212bce9c6987f05bd874c649f5f4e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/d1f7c4625b212bce9c6987f05bd874c649f5f4e4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/002495a1cb7712a9ce2320bc94541543c857205b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:40:56Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:40:56Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(rpc-handlers,chat-streaming): bound plan-limit pushes and honour null model scope\n\nA plan-limits push whose snapshot or broadcast never settled left `pushing`\nset forever, so no later ledger change reached the webview. Each leg is now\nbounded by PLAN_LIMITS_PUSH_BOUND_MS (10 s) with an unref''d timer cleared on\nsettle; a timed-out push logs its error name at debug, frees `pushing` and\nre-arms on dirty, and a push generation drops a snapshot from a stale push.\n\nThe agent monitor store merged modelScope with `??`, so the backend''s\nauthoritative null could never clear a known scope on re-open or exit. Null\nnow clears and only an absent value keeps the card''s scope. A restored card\nthat is re-opened no longer folds its first live segments into usageTotals,\nso it stays \"unknown\" instead of showing a partial run total as known.\n\nTASK_2026_616 batch 3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a58deca69fe768ebb513e3a1d3c571e3257a358f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/a58deca69fe768ebb513e3a1d3c571e3257a358f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/002495a1cb7712a9ce2320bc94541543c857205b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/002495a1cb7712a9ce2320bc94541543c857205b","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKDAwMjQ5NWExY2I3NzEyYTljZTIzMjBiYzk0NTQxNTQzYzg1NzIwNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/546aa31af7eced8224d4450f55cf9fc32f983cee","sha":"546aa31af7eced8224d4450f55cf9fc32f983cee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/546aa31af7eced8224d4450f55cf9fc32f983cee"}],"sha":"002495a1cb7712a9ce2320bc94541543c857205b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/002495a1cb7712a9ce2320bc94541543c857205b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commits/546aa31af7eced8224d4450f55cf9fc32f983cee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:26:50Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:26:50Z","email":"test@test.com","name":"Test"},"message":"fix(cli-agent-runtime): upgrade cli-store lane owners to the account and scope only ptah-cli by Claude family\n\nA lane spawned before its CLI''s account was readable stayed attributed to the\ncli-store owner for its whole run, so its exit and success landed under the\nstore rather than the account the provider bills. upgradeQuotaOwner now also\nmoves a cli-store owner to the account of the same provider, and\nrecordLaneLimits re-resolves cli-store owners at exit.\n\nresolveModelScope folded any model id containing a Claude family word onto\nthat family, so a codex or antigravity model such as gpt-5-sonnet-x was keyed\nas a Claude window. Only ptah-cli lanes, whose stream loop reports Claude\nfamilies, narrow to the family now; every other CLI keeps its full id.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a3a09935d45e02cbb3f0efe51f9a6d631679b7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/trees/3a3a09935d45e02cbb3f0efe51f9a6d631679b7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/git/commits/546aa31af7eced8224d4450f55cf9fc32f983cee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6664588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TESTPERSONAL","id":6664588,"login":"TESTPERSONAL","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjQ1ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TESTPERSONAL","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extension/commit/546aa31af7eced8224d4450f55cf9fc32f983cee","node_id":"C_kwDOPngTdtoAKDU0NmFhMzFhZjdlY2VkODIyNGQ0NDUwZjU1Y2Y5ZmMzMmY5ODNjZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hive-Academy/ptah-extens