com","name":"听孙燕姿的Jay"},"message":"🎉 初始提交: qiankun微前端示例项目\n\n✨ 功能特性:\n- 主应用 (Vue 3 + Vite + qiankun)\n- React 18 子应用 (用户管理系统)\n- Vue 3 子应用 (产品管理系统)\n- 原生JS游戏子应用 (贪吃蛇、2048、Flappy Bird)\n- Next.js 你画我猜游戏子应用\n\n🔧 技术栈:\n- 微前端框架: qiankun\n- 主应用: Vue 3 + Element Plus + Vite\n- 构建工具: Webpack, Vite\n- 样式隔离: CSS Sandbox\n- 应用间通信: Global State Management\n\n🚀 快速启动:\nnpm run install:all && npm run start:all","tree":{"sha":"a7cda7e4e985b4f85541d168b7401724fd059e13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beautifulwhale/qiankun-t/git/trees/a7cda7e4e985b4f85541d168b7401724fd059e13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beautifulwhale/qiankun-t/git/commits/23af50bff594d2c1ed13163919700a89cf9117c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81233083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beautifulwhale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beautifulwhale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beautifulwhale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beautifulwhale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/beautifulwhale","id":81233083,"login":"beautifulwhale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMjMzMDgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beautifulwhale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beautifulwhale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beautifulwhale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beautifulwhale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beautifulwhale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beautifulwhale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/beautifulwhale/qiankun-t/commit/23af50bff594d2c1ed13163919700a89cf9117c4","node_id":"C_kwDOPn48ydoAKDIzYWY1MGJmZjU5NGQyYzFlZDEzMTYzOTE5NzAwYTg5Y2Y5MTE3YzQ","p