ect management\n\n🗃 Database Schema (install.xml):\n• vibeyourcourse - Main activity table\n• vibeyourcourse_projects - Student projects & files\n• vibeyourcourse_executions - Code execution history\n• vibeyourcourse_ai_interactions - AI usage tracking\n• vibeyourcourse_analytics - Learning progress data\n\n🌐 Language Support:\n• Complete English language strings\n• Form labels, error messages, UI text\n• Privacy compliance strings\n• Achievement & progress terminology\n\n🎨 UI Features Ready:\n• Project gallery with status indicators\n• Modal dialogs for new projects\n• IDE interface layout (editor, console, preview)\n• AI assistant panel (when enabled)\n• Responsive design with Bootstrap\n\n�� Configuration Options:\n• Runtime selection (Python, JavaScript, WebContainer)\n• AI assistance levels (Full, Hints, Minimal, None)\n• Difficulty adaptation (Beginner → Advanced)\n• Project templates (JSON configurable)\n• Assessment settings (Auto-grading, Peer review)\n\nReady for Phase 2: CodeMirror integration & Pyodide setup! 🚀","tree":{"sha":"91846e5240fa8d019cb5bc6b19cdc2790681913d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Freakrider/moodle-mod_vibeyourcourse/git/trees/91846e5240fa8d019cb5bc6b19cdc2790681913d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Freakrider/moodle-mod_vibeyourcourse/git/commits/65db28b788ac631ba3e81fa9e3548762015ca657","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13573847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Freakrider/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Freakrider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Freakrider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Freakrider/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Freakrider","id":13573847,"login":"Freakrider","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTczODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/